#ASSERT `Was I given enough notice of the inquiry` (`d` 1 3 2026) (`d` 15 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was I given enough notice of the inquiry` (`d` 20 2 2026) (`d` 7 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Was I given enough notice of the inquiry` (`d` 20 2 2026) (`d` 6 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `earliest day of the inquiry` (`d` 1 3 2026) EQUALS `d` 16 3 2026

