§§ `ss 146C, 148F, 149B -- the maximum fine`

-- Arguments: profession, body, finding, no other order appropriate, court already penalised, dollars per penalty unit.
-- 250 x 110 = 27,500; 50 x 110 = 5,500.
#ASSERT `What is the most the practitioner can be fined` `medical` `the Tribunal` `professional misconduct` TRUE FALSE 110 EQUALS JUST 27500
#ASSERT `What is the most the practitioner can be fined` `medical` `the Tribunal` `unsatisfactory professional conduct` TRUE FALSE 110 EQUALS JUST 27500
#ASSERT `What is the most the practitioner can be fined` `medical` `the Tribunal` `unsatisfactory professional conduct` TRUE FALSE 100 EQUALS JUST 25000
#ASSERT `What is the most the practitioner can be fined` `medical` `PSC` `unsatisfactory professional conduct` TRUE FALSE 110 EQUALS JUST 5500
#ASSERT `What is the most the practitioner can be fined` `nursing and midwifery` `PSC` `professional misconduct` TRUE FALSE 110 EQUALS JUST 5500
#ASSERT `What is the most the practitioner can be fined` `nursing and midwifery` `PSC` `other ground` TRUE FALSE 110 EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `What is the most the practitioner can be fined` `medical` `PSC` `unsatisfactory professional conduct` FALSE FALSE 110 EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `What is the most the practitioner can be fined` `medical` `PSC` `unsatisfactory professional conduct` TRUE TRUE 110 EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `What is the most the practitioner can be fined` `pharmacy` `PSC` `unsatisfactory professional conduct` TRUE FALSE 110 EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `What is the most the practitioner can be fined` `pharmacy` `council meeting` `unsatisfactory professional conduct` TRUE FALSE 110 EQUALS JUST 5500
#ASSERT `What is the most the practitioner can be fined` `medical` `council meeting` `unsatisfactory professional conduct` TRUE FALSE 110 EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `What is the most the practitioner can be fined` `pharmacy` `AC` `unsatisfactory professional conduct` TRUE FALSE 110 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `What is the most the practitioner can be fined` `another registered health profession` `the Tribunal` `nothing proved or admitted` TRUE FALSE 110 EQUALS JUST 0

