§§ `ss 158, 158A, 161 -- appeals`

#ASSERT `Can I appeal against the Committee's decision` `PSC` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I appeal against the Committee's decision` `AC` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I appeal against the Committee's decision` `the Tribunal` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Can I appeal against the Committee's decision` `council meeting` EQUALS NOTHING

-- Arguments: day of the written reasons, day lodged, longer period allowed. Day 28 is in time; day 29 is not.
#ASSERT `Is my appeal in time` (`d` 1 3 2026) (`d` 29 3 2026) FALSE EQUALS `in time: within 28 days`
#ASSERT `Is my appeal in time` (`d` 1 3 2026) (`d` 30 3 2026) FALSE EQUALS `out of time, unless the Tribunal allows a longer period`
#ASSERT `Is my appeal in time` (`d` 1 3 2026) (`d` 30 3 2026) TRUE EQUALS `in time only because the Tribunal allowed a longer period`
#ASSERT `Is my appeal in time` (`d` 1 3 2026) (`d` 1 3 2026) FALSE EQUALS `in time: within 28 days`
#ASSERT `Is my appeal in time` (`d` 10 3 2026) (`d` 5 3 2026) FALSE EQUALS `the 28 days have not begun: no written notice of the reasons had been given`
#ASSERT `Is my appeal in time` (`d` 10 12 2026) (`d` 7 1 2027) FALSE EQUALS `in time: within 28 days`
#ASSERT `Is my appeal in time` (`d` 10 12 2026) (`d` 8 1 2027) FALSE EQUALS `out of time, unless the Tribunal allows a longer period`
#ASSERT `By when must I appeal` (`d` 1 3 2026) EQUALS `d` 29 3 2026
#ASSERT `By when must I appeal` (`d` 10 12 2026) EQUALS `d` 7 1 2027
#ASSERT `By when must I appeal` (`d` 1 2 2028) EQUALS `d` 29 2 2028

-- Arguments: stage, day of the decision on the point, day lodged.
